  "stageId": null,
  "title": "無續集",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6d08134ef6ad2d8a3b111fbd448f6f84b02c9cfbd881eb0ed8b59784fa41f0c5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（哈欠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "被褥疊成豆腐乾，這樣就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "錢包，鑰匙，外套......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "通訊設備，不帶了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "盾......也算了，老夥計，今天你就休息一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "鞋就穿這雙吧，嗯，不對，不好，要不然還是穿這雙限定版的？啊，這雙感覺也不錯，和今天的衣服挺搭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唉，不然還是換回這雙吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "（白眼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "Missy，正好，你覺得哪雙最順眼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "別問我，我現在看你哪裡都不順眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎麼了，你今天脾氣不太好。特殊日子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我好你*龍門粗口*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "一大早敲我門到底幹嘛？！就為了看你數鞋？你收藏了這麼多鞋我都看不出有什麼大區別！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那怎麼能一樣，版型和材質都差遠了......哎，我和你說這些幹什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "看在我們宿舍在兩隔壁，算鄰居的份上，互幫互助嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我管你啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "搞清楚，今天可是休息日！現在還差三分鐘到六點，我只要按下這個報警器，立刻就能告你擾民！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你想加班就自己去，整天這麼工作遲早掉髮禿頭，少拖上我一起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "加班就算了吧，難得的休假，近衛局加班費發得又不多，還挺摳門的。我又不是老陳那個工作狂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "而且Missy，這一點上你也不好說我吧？你是不是才剛從近衛局回來，我聽見你開門又摔門的聲音了，真夠響的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "囉嗦！我煩得很！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "最近事情那麼多，又有整合運動留下的爛攤子，還有那隻臭老鼠那邊的事......那個仆街龍關鍵時候又不在，哪一件不要處理？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你升個職，他們還想著要把你調走，調到哪去？特別督查組難道就交給別人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "真是氣死我了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "別氣，別氣。魏先生不是沒考慮，這是要練你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "將來近衛局還要靠你撐著，要我說，遲早的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你可以的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "......你......你又說這樣的話，這些我當然知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "可、可擔著近衛局的本來可以是......本來應該是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唉，你可別又哭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "誰哭了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "等著瞧，那條臭龍不回來拉倒，遲早有一天我會拿下近衛局。都給我等著瞧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，那還真是令人期待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "唉，不對，等等，你剛剛說，聽到我回來時候開門的聲音了？所以你是知道我一晚上沒睡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "那你還來叫我幹嘛，還說自己不是故意的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎，哎，別激動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這不是怕你把自己逼得太緊。最近事太多，咱們也有挺久沒碰面了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "喏，是不是又沒吃早飯？我買了早茶，你喜歡的炒粉，吃一點再去睡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哼，多管閒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "好，好，就算我多管閒事。你還吃嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "當然吃！拿來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "咦，你怎麼還買兩份？這麼多，怎麼吃得完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "啊......是兩份？可能是習慣了，順手就買了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "三菌禽肉絲，沙鮮醬，多加了粉根。......哼，也就那傢伙才喜歡這個口味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "這家粉選得不怎麼樣，味太淡，料不足，勉勉強強吧。下次記得要近衛局樓下轉角第二家，外面掛了個藍色招牌的，那家更好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "行了，知道了，下回再給你帶。先湊合吃點，唉，別急，慢點吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "（哈欠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "對了，你今天要去哪？反正我都醒了，要逛街可以算我一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我要去把舒爾洛夫斯基的那條首飾給買下來，新品，JOKER系列，上個禮拜剛出的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哦，就是老陳早就看中的那條？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "沒錯，就是那個，這方面她眼光倒是還行，對衣服首飾比我會挑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "難得你誇她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "要我說，這種首飾每次買回來也戴不了幾回，好在她薪資夠高，還有近衛局的免費宿舍住，要不然可夠吃力的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不過，Missy，你約我？真難得，這是不是頭一次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "要不是沒其他人選，你當我想約你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我想也是。哎，說正經的，再不出門就要遲了，我得先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哎，你去哪？等我下，我去化個妝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "別，你不化妝也挺好的，“小姐”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "多謝你約我，不過今天還是算了，我就出去兜兜風，沒什麼好跟著的。下次再載你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "去睡吧，黑眼圈留太久的話，之後想消掉可不那麼容易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你真的該多休息休息了，詩懷雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "長官，早上好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "早。你們辛苦了。吃早茶嗎，被推薦了一家店，我就順路帶了點過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "真是，休假日早上這個時間，怎麼還能在這棟樓裡見到這麼多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "那次事件之後，最近一直都這樣，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "星熊長官不也是，才離開沒幾個小時就又回來了，我記得您今天休假吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哪能這麼比，我不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "比起這個，你真的還好？我怎麼覺得你在晃......吃點東西，先去休息室躺一會吧，別喝那麼多提神飲料，對身體不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "啊，謝謝長官。不過沒事，忙完手上這些工作我就能回家睡覺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "（哈欠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "行，那我也不多說，你自己調節。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這段時間大家都辛苦了。過了這陣子，請你們吃大餐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "大餐就算了，我更想加薪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "前兩天還碰到那個羅德島辦事處的，那傢伙還和我炫耀他又晉升了......嗤，有什麼好炫耀的，不就是假期比我多點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "......羅德島？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "就是之前，和我們合作的那個，而且還帶走了陳長官的那個？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "那些人不是早就跑了嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "啊......說的是本地的那個辦事處吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我記得他們還負責招人，之前是不是還有幾個街頭的小子跑去鬧了一場，結果反給人勸去打工了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "他們口才真沒的說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你也別老是去找人家麻煩，他們辦事處那裡留的都是咱們龍門的市民，挑不出錯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "回頭和下頭的小子們也都說一聲，別亂來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "哪能呢。大家心裡清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "我們和羅德島那邊的，關係還行，偶爾還在一起喝一杯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "他們那怪人多，除了本地幾個職員，偶爾還能碰上外邊路過的。有些看起來就不簡單，我們也就忍不住多盯著點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "上周還有個拉特蘭啥修道會的姑娘也一起......別說，那些人還挺能喝的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "啊？！大哥你之前喝得爛醉回來，原來是和羅德島的人喝酒喝成那樣？！你還吐了我一身！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "啊......有這回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "當然有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "行，行，是我不好。那你下次請假去和小女朋友逛街我給你批了，行了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "再等等，等這陣子忙完，該重建的城區把重建日程都提上去，就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "這我當然知道......說真的，等這陣子過去，估計我也沒女朋友了......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "嘿那不錯。不用批假了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你啊。快少說兩句吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "他就這樣，我都習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "臭小子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的近衛局成員",
      "text": "長官也是，今天難得能有假，別在這耽擱了，趕緊回去休息吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "是啊，這裡就交給我們吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "喲，看來我不怎麼受歡迎，要不然你們怎麼老想著趕我走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "不、不是，我不是這個意思......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，行了，別緊張，開玩笑的。我就是過來看看，順便給你們送點吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "拿好，炒粉。那你們忙，我先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唉，累了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這才通宵幾天，就有點吃不消，怪難受的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "該不會是上年紀了？不應該啊，我也還勉強能算年輕吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "算是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈，算了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嗨，夥計，你怎麼想？好久沒讓你出來活動活動了，今天我們去外崗那條賽道好好來一場，透透風。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎，你今天風口聲音有點不對勁，難道你也上了年紀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不，不至於，你明明還是新款。70vv。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "雖然確實是剛出了個比你更新的款。沉穩無顛簸，風馳電掣的感覺，他們廣告一向做得挺不錯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我還挺想搞來一台試試，不過貴得很。放心吧夥計，我們互相將就一下，我薪資沒那麼高，不能總是這麼花錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你離過時還遠著，我離退休也還早，我們是挺般配的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你說，老陳這人怎麼就這麼倔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "她在羅德島還習慣嗎？會不會和人打起來？我猜會。她不是不能和人搞好關係，就怕她不樂意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "非也。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "——什麼人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "陳小姐並非陳腐頑固之人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "非一味倔強。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "啊，我當是誰。您是......白雪閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "（點頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "星熊長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不必這麼客氣，白雪閣下怎麼在這？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "夫人，暫離。命我守此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "原來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "聽說白雪閣下前段時間被夫人指派去了羅德島？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎麼樣，阿米婭小妹妹還好嗎？還有她身邊的博士......我還記得那人當時貼在遮蔽物上指揮，怪聰明也怪狼狽的。他們現在都如何了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "精力充沛，意氣高昂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "嘰哩呱啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "吵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，還是那麼有精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "看起來白雪閣下也對羅德島印象挺好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "羅德島確實不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "陳小姐也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "......不必多憂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎麼，連白雪閣下也說這樣的話......難道我看上去就是滿臉憂愁過度的樣子？真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不對啊，我要真是這樣，Missy今早就該把我臉皮都抓下來一層。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "放心吧，白雪閣下。我真沒那麼擔心老陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "真的。你別看老陳這人看起來直，有點剛極易折的意思，其實她心思細著呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我最開始認識她的時候也沒料到，之後相處多了才明白。我信只要她別鑽牛角尖，不管在哪裡都能活得像樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "陳小姐聰穎伶俐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "口齒犀利，動手亦不遜色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "等閒欺不到她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你說，哪有她那樣的？惹了她就換個方式罵人，只要占理就誰都敢罵，沒見她怕過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "陳小姐......率直。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳這脾氣，這些年其實是一直都沒怎麼變過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我總覺得她這人身上俠氣重，要是那些俠客漫畫，這樣的人就該做主角。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不過呢，有血有肉的故事好看，那些傷落在自己身上，也是真的疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我有時看著她疼得不行，就想，真值得這樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不值得。說真的，一切說開了，我就覺得真不值得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "可她覺得值。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我不擔心她吃虧，吃點虧不是壞事，太逞強會吃大苦頭的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "就怕她看不開，放不下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "陳小姐胸懷寬闊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "如今心結已除，更不可擋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "白雪閣下看得清楚。魏大人和夫人更看得明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "星熊長官，亦是俠客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我？不了，這就誇過頭了，自己的事自己清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "年輕時候不懂事，當然也做過夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "衝動的事幹過不少，也不是沒那腔熱血。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "可熱血故事結束，少年不再是少年，又怎麼辦？故事裡也不會寫這樣的事，寫了還得被讀者罵，白費力氣，不如不寫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "故事能在最好的時候有個結局，可生活不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "俠客要是像我這樣，帶了柴米油鹽煙火氣，就不討人喜歡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "不可妄自菲薄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "請看此物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這是......漫畫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "太金道，第二個巷口的書店。本月新書。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "贈與閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......真稀奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "多謝了。不過白雪閣下怎麼也讀這個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "長官一讀便知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "text": "那麼。白雪告辭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（這書......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（新人漫畫家出道作，讀者支持度總榜第二，業內漫畫家傾情推薦......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（看起來好像還不錯。封面這個是主人公？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（怎麼感覺有點，眼熟......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（這個拿盾的大個子是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "啊，哈。原來是這麼回事。怪不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "膽子不小。不過還算有分寸，畫得還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "算了。算啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "以後再見到老陳，得叫什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "陳幹員？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "挺好，還挺合適。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（速度還不夠。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（前面是......彎道。正好，還能再提一擋。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "獨角的鬼舒出一口氣。\n她很久沒像這樣在過於苛烈的風中疾馳，身下的愛車每每發出吼叫，年少時的狂妄血液似乎也總在這樣不為達到終點的飛馳中復甦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——直到身後陡然響起另一頭機械野獸的嘶鳴。\n龍門近衛局的星熊長官回過神來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（是誰......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（聲音從後面來，在接近。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "能追得上我，速度不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嚯，這線型和引擎聲，是廣告上最新那款，八成還改裝過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "加把油夥計，我們也不能輸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（怪事，什麼時候出了這麼個厲害人物，我卻還不知道？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（怎麼那麼像是那個......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（“在無人的深夜街道疾馳，閃現在彎道上的幽靈車手”。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "（等等，但是車對不上。而且，那個幽靈車手的身份可是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......不會吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "厲害。是我輸了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "承讓。剛剛那個彎道過得很好，如果不是車好些，我還超不過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "上午好，星熊督察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "比不上文月夫人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "哎呀，你好像並不驚訝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "其實還挺驚訝的，剛剛速度太快，過了那個彎道，才敢猜是您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "夫人原本的車大夥都眼熟，不會認錯，今天這輛車還是頭一次見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "那你現在要給我開罰單嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哪能呢。這段賽道本身就對外封鎖，專門供賽車用......如果這都要開罰單的話，我自己也跑不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "呵呵，平常都辛苦各位了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "應該的，不辛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "怎麼了，星熊督察，你看上去似乎還有話要說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎......也沒什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "就是覺得，這裡的風吹起來真舒服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "將油門一腳踩到底，的確會讓人心情變好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "沒錯，就是說啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "事情太多忙不過來的時候，能吹吹風，真的可以讓人好受不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "不過，你想說的不止這些吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唔......果然瞞不過夫人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我只是在想——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "魏大人這兩天停在樓下的，那輛完全不符合他興趣的奢華版水箭35炫彩機車，果然不是他自己的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
